{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25666","headline":"山出云 · 陆畅","name":"山出云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵山蓄云彩，纷郁出清晨。\n望树繁花白，看峰小雪新。\n映松张盖影，依涧布鱼鳞。\n高似从龙处，低如触石频。\n浓光藏半岫，浅色类飘尘。\n玉叶开天际，遥怜占早春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆畅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}